        "visual_fallback": "historic city map"
      },
      {
        "narration": "It wasn't a sudden disaster or a supernatural event. World wars shifted European travel, and Egypt's political landscape transformed overnight, leaving grand colonial hotels stranded in changing economies.",
        "visual_query": "historical cairo desert landscape",
        "visual_fallback": "desert horizon"
      },
      {
        "narration": "Properties like the Helwan Grand fell into disuse, stripped for building materials, and left to decay beneath shifting desert sands and urban sprawl.",
